B.aUZ=new A.ec(["The Cave of Thawr","Three nights in the cave","With Abu Bakr beside him, and the hunters at the mouth of the cave, he said: \u201cdo not grieve; indeed Allah is with us\u201d (9:40). Later tradition adds a spider\u2019s web; it is not in the Qur\u2019an or in Bukhari 3905.","Qur\u2019an 9:40"])
