B.aEH=s(["shin","sheen","letter shin","the shin"],t.s)
B.bju=new A.d9(B.aEH,"Sh\u012bn (\u0634) \u2014 It is made with the middle of the tongue against the roof of the mouth, the breath spreading out. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for Sh\u012bn: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
