B.bgp=new A.d9(B.auF,"\u02bfAyn (\u0639) \u2014 It is made in the middle of the throat. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for \u02bfAyn: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
B.aC5=s(["ghayn","ghain","letter ghayn","the ghayn"],t.s)
B.bfL=new A.d9(B.aC5,"Ghayn (\u063a) \u2014 It is made at the top of the throat, nearest the mouth, and it is a heavy letter. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for Ghayn: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
