B.bf3=new A.d9(B.aDH,"F\u0101 (\u0641) \u2014 It is made with the upper front teeth touching the inside of the lower lip. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for F\u0101: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
B.aDC=s(["qaf","letter qaf","the qaf"],t.s)
B.bjO=new A.d9(B.aDC,"Q\u0101f (\u0642) \u2014 It is a heavy letter, made at the very back of the tongue against the soft palate. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for Q\u0101f: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
