B.bfR=new A.d9(B.aGN,"L\u0101m (\u0644) \u2014 It is made with the edge of the tongue against the gum above the upper front teeth. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for L\u0101m: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
