B.bfc=new A.d9(B.aDv,"M\u012bm (\u0645) \u2014 It is made with both lips together, with a hum through the nose. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for M\u012bm: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
